Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
 libxkbcommon0, libfontconfig1
Description: line-oriented text editor with multi-colour highlighting
 NotePad Pro is a desktop notepad written in Rust with a Slint UI.
 It provides simple and multi-colour line highlighting, extract-by-colour,
 list mode (bullet / numbered / checkbox), a SQLite-backed notes sidebar,
 seven themes, liquid animations, custom window controls and a 200-state
 undo history.
 .
 The binary is fully self-contained; all rendering is done with Slint's
 software renderer — no WebView or browser engine is used.
